<title>USA: Phillips, Wis., won by Firstar Bank.</title>
<headline>Phillips, Wis., won by Firstar Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firstar Bank said it won $2.600 million of Phillips, Wis., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1996 A, with a true interest cost of 4.89 percent.</p>
</text>
